  },"decision":{"summary":"Only edge-1iw5pwq is unsupported due to missing evidence of a requirement for real-time valve state logging. The other edges are supported by direct source passages establishing pressure baselines and alarm logic.","evidenceUsed":["b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1","da0260c0-7d49-43e8-b074-da2a14c7d59c#1"],"unknowns":["Whether a requirement exists for shift logs to capture valve states during boundary preparation.","What specific equipment or process condition caused the pressure drop at P-R."],"alternatives":["The air loss originated upstream of P-U (unlikely given stable readings).","A localized leak in distribution path between U and R.","Valve mispositioning not captured by directory due to its stated limitations as a location index only."],"confidence":0.85}}
